sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Trigger
  participant H as The Hive
  participant A as Agent (claude -p)
  participant L as Ledger
  participant U as You (inbox)
  T->>H: schedule, message, Run now or Slack
  H->>A: resume the agent's session
  A->>L: ledger_read
  A->>A: do the job in the body
  alt needs you
    A->>L: ledger_ask
    L->>U: inbox card
    U->>L: answer
    L->>H: the answer wakes the agent
  else finished
    A->>L: ledger_done
    L->>U: done card
  end
